        <h2 data-template-id="news-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-['Fraunces'] font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">News</h2>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 border-l-2 border-[#A18000] pl-5">
         <li data-template-id="news-one" class="canva-text text-sm leading-6" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Chegaram novas obras de ficção científica e literatura brasileira.</li>
         <li data-template-id="news-two" class="canva-text text-sm leading-6" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Clube de leitura de outubro abre inscrições nesta semana.</li>
         <li data-template-id="news-three" class="canva-text text-sm leading-6" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Nova coleção digital: clássicos comentados por leitores.</li>
        </ul>
       </section>
       <section data-template-id="promo-panel" class="canva-panel relative mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-5" style="background: rgb(0, 22, 122);">
        <p data-template-id="promo-label" class="canva-text text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em]" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Propaganda</p>
        <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] items-center gap-4"><img data-template-id="promo-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image cover rounded-xl" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1005012/pexels-photo-1005012.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Livro e luzes decorativas em uma cena de leitura acolhedora">
         <div>
          <h2 data-template-id="promo-title" class="canva-text font-['Fraunces'] font-bold" style="color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Harry Potter e a Ordem da Fênix</h2>
          <p data-template-id="promo-description" class="canva-text mt-2 text-sm leading-6" style="color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Uma jornada de magia, coragem e amizade.</p><button data-template-id="promo-button" class="canva-button detail-button mt-4 rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold" type="button" data-book="Harry Potter e a Ordem da Fênix" data-author="J. K. Rowling" data-category="Fantasia" data-description="Uma aventura fantástica em que Harry retorna a Hogwarts e enfrenta mudanças que ameaçam o mundo bruxo." style="background: rgb(161, 128, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Saiba mais</button>
         </div>
        </div>
       </section>
      </aside>
     </div>
     <div id="empty-state" class="hidden mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-[#A18000] bg-[#FFEDCD]/70 px-6 py-10 text-center"><i data-lucide="book-x" class="mx-auto h-8 w-8 text-[#A18000]"></i>
      <h2 data-template-id="empty-title" class="canva-text mt-4 font-['Fraunces'] font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Nenhum livro encontrado</h2>
      <p data-template-id="empty-description" class="canva-text mt-2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Tente outro título, autor ou categoria para continuar explorando.</p>
     </div>
    </section>
    <section id="populares" class="border-y border-[#00167A]/20 bg-[#00167A] py-14">
     <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8">
      <p data-template-id="popular-kicker" class="canva-text text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em]" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;">Em alta na estante</p>
      <h2 data-template-id="popular-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-['Fraunces'] font-bold" style="color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Mais populares</h2>
      <div class="mt-7 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
       <article class="book-card book-item overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-title="Memórias de um Farol" data-author="Ana Faria" data-category="Ficção" data-description="Uma história sobre família, mar e a coragem de recomeçar."><img data-template-id="popular-one-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image cover w-full" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2908984/pexels-photo-2908984.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Biblioteca com livros em prateleiras de madeira">
        <div class="p-4">
         <span data-template-id="popular-one-category" class="canva-tag text-xs font-bold" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Ficção</span>
         <h3 data-template-id="popular-one-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Memórias de um Farol</h3><button class="detail-button mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#00167A] underline decoration-[#A18000] underline-offset-4" type="button" data-book="Memórias de um Farol" data-author="Ana Faria" data-category="Ficção" data-description="Uma história sobre família, mar e a coragem de recomeçar.">Detalhes</button>
        </div>
       </article>
       <article class="book-card book-item overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-title="Código Afetivo" data-author="Rafael Leal" data-category="Tecnologia" data-description="Ensaios acessíveis sobre tecnologia, criatividade e relações humanas."><img data-template-id="popular-two-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image cover w-full" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1181671/pexels-photo-1181671.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Pessoa lendo um livro em ambiente interno">
        <div class="p-4">
         <span data-template-id="popular-two-category" class="canva-tag text-xs font-bold" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Tecnologia</span>
         <h3 data-template-id="popular-two-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Código Afetivo</h3><button class="detail-button mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#00167A] underline decoration-[#A18000] underline-offset-4" type="button" data-book="Código Afetivo" data-author="Rafael Leal" data-category="Tecnologia" data-description="Ensaios acessíveis sobre tecnologia, criatividade e relações humanas.">Detalhes</button>
        </div>
       </article>
       <article class="book-card book-item overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-title="Órbita Azul" data-author="Nina Campos" data-category="Fantasia" data-description="Uma tripulação encontra uma biblioteca flutuando entre mundos desconhecidos."><img data-template-id="popular-three-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image cover w-full" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/2653362/pexels-photo-2653362.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Código em tela escura representando tecnologia moderna">
        <div class="p-4">
         <span data-template-id="popular-three-category" class="canva-tag text-xs font-bold" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Fantasia</span>
         <h3 data-template-id="popular-three-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Órbita Azul</h3><button class="detail-button mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#00167A] underline decoration-[#A18000] underline-offset-4" type="button" data-book="Órbita Azul" data-author="Nina Campos" data-category="Fantasia" data-description="Uma tripulação encontra uma biblioteca flutuando entre mundos desconhecidos.">Detalhes</button>
        </div>
       </article>
       <article class="book-card book-item overflow-hidden rounded-2xl" data-title="Cartas para Domingo" data-author="Bela Motta" data-category="Romance" data-description="Cartas encontradas por acaso aproximam duas pessoas em tempos diferentes."><img data-template-id="popular-four-image" loading="lazy" class="canva-image cover w-full" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/1765033/pexels-photo-1765033.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=800" alt="Caderno azul em fundo rosa">
        <div class="p-4">
         <span data-template-id="popular-four-category" class="canva-tag text-xs font-bold" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Romance</span>
         <h3 data-template-id="popular-four-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 17px;">Cartas para Domingo</h3><button class="detail-button mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#00167A] underline decoration-[#A18000] underline-offset-4" type="button" data-book="Cartas para Domingo" data-author="Bela Motta" data-category="Romance" data-description="Cartas encontradas por acaso aproximam duas pessoas em tempos diferentes.">Detalhes</button>
        </div>
       </article>
      </div>
     </div>
    </section>
    <section id="categorias" class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 lg:px-8">
     <p data-template-id="categories-kicker" class="canva-text text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em]" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;">Navegue por assunto</p>
     <h2 data-template-id="categories-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-['Fraunces'] font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Categorias</h2>
     <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3" role="group" aria-label="Filtrar por categoria"><button data-template-id="category-fiction" class="canva-tag category-chip rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold" type="button" data-category-filter="Ficção" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Ficção</button> <button data-template-id="category-tech" class="canva-tag category-chip rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold" type="button" data-category-filter="Tecnologia" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Tecnologia</button> <button data-template-id="category-romance" class="canva-tag category-chip rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold" type="button" data-category-filter="Romance" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Romance</button> <button data-template-id="category-fantasy" class="canva-tag category-chip rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold" type="button" data-category-filter="Fantasia" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Fantasia</button> <button data-template-id="category-mystery" class="canva-tag category-chip rounded-full px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold" type="button" data-category-filter="Mistério" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Mistério</button>
     </div>
    </section>
   </main>
   <footer data-template-id="footer-section" class="canva-footer border-t border-[#A18000]/50" style="background: rgb(0, 0, 0);">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col justify-between gap-7 px-5 py-9 sm:flex-row sm:items-center lg:px-8">
     <div>
      <p data-template-id="footer-brand" class="canva-text brand-word font-bold" style="color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">BIBLIOTECH</p>
      <p data-template-id="footer-copy" class="canva-text mt-2 text-sm" style="color: rgb(226, 212, 187); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Sua próxima leitura está a um clique de distância.</p>
     </div>
     <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm">
      <a data-template-id="footer-about" class="canva-link hover:text-[#A18000]" href="#inicio" style="color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Sobre</a><a data-template-id="footer-contact" class="canva-link hover:text-[#A18000]" href="#livros" style="color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Acervo</a><a class="rounded-md text-[#FFEDCD] hover:text-[#A18000]" href="https://www.instagram.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram"><i data-lucide="instagram" class="h-5 w-5"></i></a><a class="rounded-md text-[#FFEDCD] hover:text-[#A18000]" href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube"><i data-lucide="youtube" class="h-5 w-5"></i></a>
     </div>
    </div>
   </footer>
  </div>
  <div id="detail-modal" class="modal-backdrop fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="detail-modal-title">
   <div class="modal-panel w-full max-w-lg overflow-y-auto rounded-2xl border border-[#A18000] bg-[#FFEDCD] p-6 shadow-2xl">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
     <p data-template-id="detail-modal-label" class="canva-text text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em]" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Detalhes do livro</p><button class="modal-close rounded-lg p-2 text-[#00167A] hover:bg-[#E2D4BB]" type="button" aria-label="Fechar detalhes"><i data-lucide="x" class="h-5 w-5"></i></button>
    </div>
    <h2 id="detail-modal-title" class="mt-4 font-['Fraunces'] text-2xl font-bold text-[#000000]"></h2>
    <p id="detail-modal-author" class="mt-1 text-[#00167A]"></p><span id="detail-modal-category" class="mt-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#E2D4BB] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[#00167A]"></span>
    <p id="detail-modal-description" class="mt-5 leading-7 text-[#000000]"></p>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div id="login-modal" class="modal-backdrop fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden items-center justify-center p-4" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="login-modal-title">
   <div class="w-full max-w-md rounded-2xl border border-[#A18000] bg-[#FFEDCD] p-6 shadow-2xl">
    <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
     <div>
      <p data-template-id="login-modal-kicker" class="canva-text text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em]" style="color: rgb(161, 128, 0); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Acesso BIBLIOTECH</p>
      <h2 data-template-id="login-modal-title" id="login-modal-title" class="canva-text mt-2 font-['Fraunces'] font-bold" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 24px;">Continue sua jornada leitora</h2>
     </div><button class="modal-close rounded-lg p-2 text-[#00167A] hover:bg-[#E2D4BB]" type="button" aria-label="Fechar acesso"><i data-lucide="x" class="h-5 w-5"></i></button>
    </div>
    <p data-template-id="login-modal-description" class="canva-text mt-4 text-sm leading-6" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Informe seu e-mail para receber novidades, curadorias e convites da biblioteca.</p>
    <form id="access-form" class="mt-5">
     <label data-template-id="access-email-label" class="canva-text mb-2 block text-sm font-bold" for="access-email" style="color: rgb(0, 22, 122); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Seu e-mail</label><input id="access-email" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-[#00167A]/45 bg-[#FFF8E8] px-4 py-3 text-[#000000] outline-none" type="email" required=""><button data-template-id="access-submit" class="canva-button mt-4 w-full rounded-xl px-4 py-3 font-bold" type="submit" style="background: rgb(0, 22, 122); color: rgb(255, 237, 205); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;">Quero receber novidades</button>
     <p id="access-message" class="mt-3 min-h-5 text-sm font-medium text-[#00167A]" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div id="toast" class="toast fixed bottom-5 right-5 z-[60] rounded-xl border border-[#A18000] bg-[#000000] px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[#FFEDCD] shadow-xl" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <script>
    let backendRecords = [];
    let initialLoadTimer;
    let activeCategory = "";
    const toast = document.getElementById("toast");

    function showToast(message) {
      toast.textContent = message;
      toast.classList.add("show");
      setTimeout(() => toast.classList.remove("show"), 2800);
    }

    function isFavorite(title) {
      return backendRecords.some(record => record.book_title === title && record.book_title !== "__preference__");
    }

    function updateFavoriteUI() {
      document.querySelectorAll(".favorite-button").forEach(button => {
        const active = isFavorite(button.dataset.book);
        button.classList.toggle("is-favorite", active);
        button.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(active));
      });
    }

    function filterBooks() {
      const query = document.getElementById("book-search").value.trim().toLowerCase();
      let count = 0;
      document.querySelectorAll(".book-item").forEach(card => {
        const haystack = [card.dataset.title, card.dataset.author, card.dataset.category].join(" ").toLowerCase();
        const matched = (!query || haystack.includes(query)) && (!activeCategory || card.dataset.category === activeCategory);
        card.classList.toggle("hidden-card", !matched);
        if (matched) count++;
      });
      document.getElementById("empty-state").classList.toggle("hidden", count !== 0);
      document.getElementById("filter-status").textContent = (query || activeCategory) ? `${count} livro${count === 1 ? "" : "s"} encontrado${count === 1 ? "" : "s"}.` : "";
      document.getElementById("search-clear").classList.toggle("hidden", !query);
    }

    function openModal(id) {
      const modal = document.getElementById(id);
      modal.classList.remove("hidden");
      modal.classList.add("flex");
    }

    function closeModal(modal) {
      modal.classList.add("hidden");
      modal.classList.remove("flex");
    }

    const handler = {
      onDataChanged(data) {
        clearTimeout(initialLoadTimer);
        backendRecords = data;
        const preference = data.find(record => record.book_title === "__preference__");
        if (preference) activeCategory = preference.category || "";
        document.querySelectorAll("[data-category-filter]").forEach(button => button.classList.toggle("active", button.dataset.categoryFilter === activeCategory));
        updateFavoriteUI();
        filterBooks();
      }
    };

    async function initializeDataSdk() {
      clearTimeout(initialLoadTimer);
      initialLoadTimer = setTimeout(() => showToast("Não foi possível carregar suas preferências. Tente novamente mais tarde."), 8000);
      const initResult = await window.dataSdk.init(handler);
      if (!initResult.isOk) {
        clearTimeout(initialLoadTimer);
        showToast("Não foi possível iniciar suas preferências salvas.");
      }
    }

    async function toggleFavorite(button) {
      const existing = backendRecords.find(record => record.book_title === button.dataset.book);
      button.disabled = true;
      try {
        const result = existing
          ? await window.dataSdk.delete(existing)
          : await window.dataSdk.create({ book_title: button.dataset.book, category: button.dataset.category, favorited_at: new Date().toISOString() });
        if (!result.isOk) showToast("Não foi possível confirmar esta alteração. Atualize antes de tentar novamente.");
        else showToast(existing ? "Livro removido dos favoritos." : "Livro salvo nos favoritos.");
      } finally {
        button.disabled = false;
      }
    }

    async function saveCategoryPreference(category) {
      const current = backendRecords.find(record => record.book_title === "__preference__");
      const record = { book_title: "__preference__", category, favorited_at: new Date().toISOString() };
      const result = current ? await window.dataSdk.update({ ...current, ...record }) : await window.dataSdk.create(record);
      if (!result.isOk) showToast("Não foi possível salvar sua preferência de categoria.");
    }

    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
      lucide.createIcons();
      initializeDataSdk();

      document.getElementById("book-search").addEventListener("input", filterBooks);
      document.getElementById("search-clear").addEventListener("click", () => {
        document.getElementById("book-search").value = "";
        filterBooks();
        document.getElementById("book-search").focus();
      });

      document.querySelectorAll(".detail-button").forEach(button => button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        document.getElementById("detail-modal-title").textContent = button.dataset.book;
        document.getElementById("detail-modal-author").textContent = `por ${button.dataset.author}`;
        document.getElementById("detail-modal-category").textContent = button.dataset.category;
        document.getElementById("detail-modal-description").textContent = button.dataset.description;
        openModal("detail-modal");
      }));

      document.querySelectorAll(".favorite-button").forEach(button => button.addEventListener("click", () => toggleFavorite(button)));

      document.querySelectorAll("[data-category-filter]").forEach(button => button.addEventListener("click", async () => {
        const category = button.dataset.categoryFilter;
        activeCategory = activeCategory === category ? "" : category;
        document.querySelectorAll("[data-category-filter]").forEach(item => item.classList.toggle("active", item.dataset.categoryFilter === activeCategory));
        filterBooks();
        await saveCategoryPreference(activeCategory);
      }));

      document.getElementById("login-open").addEventListener("click", () => openModal("login-modal"));
      document.querySelectorAll(".modal-close").forEach(button => button.addEventListener("click", () => closeModal(button.closest(".modal-backdrop"))));
      document.querySelectorAll(".modal-backdrop").forEach(modal => modal.addEventListener("click", event => {
        if (event.target === modal) closeModal(modal);
      }));
      document.addEventListener("keydown", event => {
        if (event.key === "Escape") document.querySelectorAll(".modal-backdrop.flex").forEach(closeModal);
      });

      document.getElementById("access-form").addEventListener("submit", event => {
        event.preventDefault();
        document.getElementById("access-message").textContent = "Recebemos seu e-mail. Em breve você receberá novidades da BIBLIOTECH.";
        event.currentTarget.reset();
      });
    });
  </script>
 
</body></html>